        "id": 19205,
        "name": "“Mad Dog”",
        "username": "_Mad_Dog",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/_mad_dog/{size}/4859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-22T14:50:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>All,</p>\n<p>&nbsp; So, I unlocked the \" Completionist Guise\" variant last night.&nbsp; While I am not a big Guise fan (sorry Jeff), this variant intrigues me.&nbsp; I played a few matches with him and found that while he works with some teammates very well, others are not so much a good match.&nbsp; So, who would you have on Completionist Guise's team and why?</p>\n<p>&nbsp; I've come up with a few good combos.</p>\n<p>1) Absolute Zero</p>\n<p>Start out with \"Freedom Five Absolute Zero\", get a few ongoing cards in play (\"Impale\", maybe \"Sub-Zero Atmosphere\" if it makes sense) and hopefully get a few equipment cards in play at the same time, then switch to base Absolute Zero to heal up from his damage from his F5 innate power or make attacks.</p>\n<p>2) The Naturalist</p>\n<p>Start with his base character card.&nbsp; Use his innate power to get a \"form\" card in play, then immediately switch to \"Hunted\" variant.&nbsp; Now he has access to the \"form\" in play and what he picks from his new innate power.&nbsp; And if he gets \"Natural-Born Vigor\" into play, he can really have a lot of options every turn.</p>\n<p>What other heroes work well with Completionist Guise?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:48.817Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
