        "created_at": "2019-05-22T15:04:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just a couple I’ll post real quick</p>\n<p>Captain Cosmic. &nbsp; Use either Base or Requital to get Constructs in play and then switch to XPW or PW versions to take advantage of them.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Tachyon. &nbsp;Switching between F5 Tachyon and SST. &nbsp;SST can quickly get bursts into the trash, switch to F5 to stack the bottom of your deck with bursts, and switch back to SST to have guaranteed experiments. &nbsp;</p>",
