        "created_at": "2019-05-22T18:00:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First one I thought of when I tested him out was Writhe.&nbsp; Start with base Writhe to guarantee getting the Shadow Cloak out right away, then switch to Cosmic Inventor, who arguably has the better power.</p>\n<p>Freedom Six Tempest and Horus Ra would be decent options too, since you can use their powers to draw more cards at the start and then switch to more useful powers once you have what you need.</p>",
