        "created_at": "2019-05-22T19:40:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Really anyone with a card drawing/playing power is good for this either for thier self setup or just supporting the team until everyone's ready to go.&nbsp; Legacy and his 4 varients with rocking powers is especially great.</p>",
