      {
        "id": 227637,
        "name": "payprplayn",
        "username": "payprplayn",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b2d939/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-14T10:19:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fanatic.</p>\n<p>Here’s how it works.</p>\n<p>You start with Xtreme Fanatic. She uses her power, targets something, probably the villain, and gets switched to Prime Wardens Fanatic on Guise’s turn. He also uses her power to target most likely that same target.</p>\n<p>The next round, Fanatic uses Resolute, deals 3 radiant damage to the target she’s locked on to, plays the top card of her deck and gives someone else a power. And then Guise switches her back to Xtreme Fanatic, and does the exact same thing.</p>\n<p>You keep that up long enough, nothing will survive. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I think this one may be bugged in my game.  It seems like if I use extreme fanatic’s power with guise, it cancels the redirection from her. If, on the other hand, I choose the 2 psychic damage, fanatic continues to redirect. welp, guess it’s time to submit a bug report.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:52.775Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 19204,
        "topic_slug": "good-teammates-for-completionist-guise",
        "display_username": "payprplayn",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
